==Battleground==
*3 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[THE FOLIVOREAN]] spawns.
**2 [[Winged Pigge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 93.33~100 seconds<sup>2,800f~3,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 63.33~70 seconds<sup>1,900f~2,100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**6 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

